@startuml
[*] --> Assigned

state Assigned {
  [*] --> Available : assignToClientOrCampaign
}

Available --> Unassigned : removeAssignment
Available --> Assigned : switchAssignments

Unassigned --> Assigned : reassign

Assigned --> [*] : markUnemployed
Assigned --> Archived : archiveRecord

Archived --> [*] : [*]
@enduml
